0 g BT /F2 11.00 Tf 56.69 339.59 Td (How to use it) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 9.50 Tf 56.69 319.75 Td (1. Cut one marker out along the dashed circle. Keep the white border: the) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 9.50 Tf 56.69 305.01 Td (    app needs it to see the edge of the black ring.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 9.50 Tf 56.69 290.27 Td (2. Stick it on the gauge, lower right, facing the phone: on the glass over) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 9.50 Tf 56.69 275.53 Td (    the logo \(keep the 0-11 bar scale free\) or on the rubber guard. On the) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 9.50 Tf 56.69 260.79 Td (    gauge it moves with it and the app finds the dial from the marker alone.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 9.50 Tf 56.69 246.05 Td (3. It must stay in view during the whole shot: not under the lever or your) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 9.50 Tf 56.69 231.31 Td (    hand, and without glare \(plain paper; no glossy tape over it\).) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 9.50 Tf 56.69 216.57 Td (4. The wedge may point any way, but the marker must not move afterwards.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 9.50 Tf 56.69 201.83 Td (5. Calibrate again \(Brew > target icon\). The app says "Marker found".) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 9.50 Tf 56.69 187.09 Td (    Not found: use a bigger size, or bring the phone a little closer.) Tj ET
